==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Jar Base (Enemy Base)|Jar Base]].
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Though the Shy Boys may appear threatening, by the time they make their appearance, you'll already have a good stack to handle them. None of the other enemies are threatening.

